VPC - Virtual Private Cloud
===========================
Application ==>> .war

Servers, Storages and Load Balancers Etc ==>> Created within a VPC [Network].

Virtual Private Cloud is a private network in AWS in which we can create aws resources like EC2, EBS and ELB Etc.

AWS is a public cloud and anyone can use AWS to create infrastructure.

We shouldn't create infrastructure in Default,
We will not have control over Default VPC as it will be created and managed by Cloud Provider.

VPC is all about Network,
We can use VPC to isolate resources in one network from other network.
We can have full control on VPC like IP addresses, Its routing, security groups and subnets.

AWS will not charge for VPCs.
It will charge for resources created in a VPC.

VPC Components,
CIDR - classless inter domain routing.
subnet mask.
subnets.
route tables.
IGW - Internet Gateway.
NAT Gateway.
Secruity Groups.
NACLs - Network access  control lists.

