=============
Popular Web Servers come load balancers,
Nginx,
Apache Httpd Etc [Software Load Balancers]

Hardware Load Balancer
F5

ELB - Elastic Load Balancing,
ELB will be created and managed by AWS Cloud provider.

Types of Load Balancers,
Network Load Balancer [Layer 4 TCP Protocol]
Application Load Balancer [Layer 7 - Http and Https Protocol].

OSI Model [Open System Interconnection]

Application Layer.
Presentation Layer.
Session Layer.
Transport Layer.
Network layer.
Datalink layer.
Physical.


NLB and ALB ELBS
===========

NLB - Layer 4
It will just receive traffic and it will send traffic to some IPs on some port.

ALB - Layer 7
It is capable of routing traffic based on host of the applicaiton or based on path of the applicaiton
https://www.google.com/
https://www.google.com/search
We can route traffic to multiple target groups/servers with single load balancer.
We can achieve advanced routing techniques like if host is google.com then route traffic to so and so target group.

Load Balancer will accept/receive traffic on port 80 [http] and 443 [Https].

Elastic Load Balancer Concepts
==============================
Listener.
Target.
TargetGroups.

Listener,
Each load balancer should have atleast one listener to accept the traffic.
Routing rules are defined on listeners.

Target,
Target is where request should reach.
Target is nothing but a server where our application is running.

We cannot use target in load balncer directly.

Target Groups
Grouping of application servers into a Target Group
Target group will be used in load balancers.
Logical grouping of targers behind the load balancer.

Health Checks,
Load Balancer will perform health checks on targets to identify targets are healthy or not.
When load balancer finds any application server is not healthy then load balancer will stop routing traffic to unhealthy server.
Health checks ensures user traffic is shifted away from failed instances.

Types of Load Balancers,
Internal Load Balancer
Internet Facing Load Balancer

Internal Load Balancer,
ILB cannot be access from internet.

Internet Facing Load Balancer,
Internet Facing Load Balancer can be access from internet.
To creat Internet Facing Load Balancer,
we need minimum 2 pubilc subnets available in a VPC in wihc we create load balancer.
Because 2 load balancer instances will be created by AWS in background for load balacner.

