Users Groups
===========
Group will have one or more users.
We can add polices to the created group.

Policies
========
We can give specific permissions [create, list and delete] to a specific AWS resources.
AWS resources like EC2, EBS, EFS, S3, EBB and EKS Etc.

Types of policies
AWS Managed policies.
Customer managed policy - we can create custom polices based on requirement.

Roles
=====
We can create role by attaching polices [permissions].
Roles can be used to gie aws permissions to AWS resources like EC2.

IAM User
We use IAM user, when granting permissions to Users to access aws resources.

IAM Role
We use IAM role, when granting permissions to any aws services to access another aws service.

Identity Providers
==================
It is a trusted service that authenticates users, sends that identity information to AWS so the user can access aws resources wihtout creating an IAM user in account.

